<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f2f2; }
      p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #333333; font-size: 18px; }
      a { color: #ff6600; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .btn { background-color: #ff6600; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
      .btn:hover { background-color: #4d4d4d; color: #ffffff; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #ffffff; }
      h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #ff6600; text-align: center; }
      ul { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #333333; font-size: 18px; padding-left: 24px; }
      .small-text { font-size: 18px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Thank you for upgrading to COD King!</h1>

      <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>

      <p>
        Thank you for purchasing COD King. Your support and trust mean a lot to us. As a paid plan member, you now have access to:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>24/7 Priority Support</li>
        <li>Free installation service</li>
        <li>Free onboarding sessions</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Explore our step-by-step guides and resources to get the most out of COD King:
      </p>

      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="https://codking.tech/documentation/" target="_blank" class="btn">View documentation</a>
      </p>

      <p>
        To book an exclusive onboarding session with us, <a href="https://calendly.com/birdchime/meet" target="_blank">click here</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Need help? Chat with us instantly:
      </p>

      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank" class="btn">Chat with us now!</a>
      </p>

      <p>We value your feedback and are committed to making COD King the best COD app for your store.</p>
      <p>Looking forward to a long-term partnership with <strong><%= @owner_name %></strong>.</p>

      <p class="small-text">Best regards,</p>
      <p class="small-text">The COD King Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
